<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<contentList>
	<content contentuid="hdcf9a002g703fg43dbg9a85g45f68668ee75" version="1">年迈的乞丐</content>
	<content contentuid="h0fb4ab2egbca0g4a2ag88d3g8abc5b8dcacf" version="1">被遗忘之人</content>
	<content contentuid="hdb7f18a2g26b9g4736gb3edg9520e7a1eaac" version="1">无主之人</content>
	<content contentuid="h2875a416g6c08g4605gafeeg20fb8409a976" version="1">一个毫不起眼的老头。身上发臭，还不停地嘟囔。仔细听，你会发现他多么频繁地求人杀了他。</content>

	<content contentuid="h272f30c7g9d92g49f3g8520gdcb3e4db4df8" version="1">铁心</content>
	<content contentuid="h3801086fgb7e1g4ccdg8fa3g3e414615ea32" version="1">宝生家的刀</content>
	<content contentuid="h485a791cg049cg49b7g92dcgd73665094dbe" version="1">没有鞘的刀</content>
	<content contentuid="h7c1ea5f2ge2cfg48c3ga275gda8b60cfdb33" version="1">宝生家正直而英勇，照拂病弱与贫苦之人，至少人们是这样记得的。直到食人的马崎一族发动了那场臭名昭著的袭击，将整条血脉尽数斩断。只有侍奉宝生家的武士铁心及时饮下了禁忌的龙泉之水，为马崎所流的血报了仇。他所换来的不死之身代价高昂：各种异界之物被引到他身边，其中就有至黑者，与他订下了一份「英勇」的契约，许诺让他速死。当然，那一天从未到来。</content>

	<content contentuid="h82baff6eg9a50g46a5g8ce3gee38181d681e" version="1">食尸者</content>
	<content contentuid="h69f649ecg9561g4af5g9a61g280de9100321" version="1">禁忌龙泉的馈赠</content>
	<content contentuid="hfaec5894ga99dg4618ga2a1g4eade98d3228" version="1">归途</content>
	<content contentuid="h81214ee1g438dg49c8gbd49g8cecffd022cc" version="1">铁心倒在他倒下的地方。只有在他倒地期间，螃蟹才会在外面。在他起身之前杀死螃蟹，两者一同死去。</content>

	<content contentuid="h4466ff61gdf17g494ega0edgb495afb306d1" version="1">借来的英勇</content>
	<content contentuid="h4ec3d32bg5682g4432g9e14ga2de4f0481a5" version="1">&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;范围内的盟友的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻击检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;与&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;获得 &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="he086a0aag6bc1g4019g8a3agc0f2e769290c" version="1">长者的守护</content>
	<content contentuid="h904f04a3g523ag473aga053g9f6811995835" version="1">&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;范围内的盟友获得 &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; 点&lt;LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;护甲等级&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="hd488335eg4807g4439g8baag086682301d98" version="1">长寿之臭</content>
	<content contentuid="h1b5de808g8af4g4a0eg928bg44e812809d5c" version="1">&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;范围内的敌人必须通过&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Constitution"&gt;体质&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，否则将&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="POISONED"&gt;中毒&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h8fef07bfg1f7cg4319g973ega7c501c1e34b" version="1">血潮</content>
	<content contentuid="h9309bf94g5b20g43d8gbe82g79c6fc4d7649" version="1">当铁心处于&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;流血&lt;/LSTag&gt;状态时，&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;范围内的敌人必须通过&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Constitution"&gt;体质&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，否则将&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="POISONED"&gt;中毒&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>

	<content contentuid="h274df589g4ef7g4061gae49gbb69d9e7ed68" version="1">龙泉不肯放手</content>
	<content contentuid="h5b5419c8ge002g4bc9g8bcag9efe080e771d" version="1">铁心在自己每个回合开始时回复 &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; 点&lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;生命值&lt;/LSTag&gt;。没有任何事物能打断它，即使处于&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="DOWNED"&gt;倒地&lt;/LSTag&gt;状态。</content>
	<content contentuid="h5c63d4dag5ce2g41d4ga55eg2b3441a70ff6" version="1">修补皮囊</content>
	<content contentuid="h65e2e377g846ag4ffegb2f9g0a0a5e551733" version="1">每当攻击或法术使铁心受伤，他便回复 &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; 点&lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;生命值&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h0567573fga23bg4668g8e5cgd98a4b010d11" version="1">以痛为供</content>
	<content contentuid="hd2799be8g2ca5g4790gb5a2g2f830a319d90" version="1">对铁心造成的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;重击&lt;/LSTag&gt;会让他获得 &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; 点&lt;LSTag Tooltip="TemporaryHitPoints"&gt;临时生命值&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h48b32537g6a81g4d75g98ebg34405daca141" version="1">力道不足</content>
	<content contentuid="h39b19a70g3976g471fgb652g51a9c5c9e138" version="1">任何致命一击都杀不死铁心。他只会倒下，而在他倒地期间，藏在他体内的螃蟹会爬出来。在他起身之前杀死螃蟹，两者一同死去。</content>
	<content contentuid="h2af5500ag76eag43e5ga1eag6c886a914c53" version="1">嗅得出毒</content>
	<content contentuid="h03520dcbgba05g44dbgb218g8782d0ac7933" version="1">持用者对&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="POISONED"&gt;中毒&lt;/LSTag&gt;目标的攻击拥有&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Advantage"&gt;优势&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>

	<content contentuid="hb4b1bedcg722ag4d98g8c92g1141f095de60" version="1">双刃斩</content>
	<content contentuid="h1e11f42ag94bfg4cfag9dd1gd79bfedb9fba" version="1">铁心以一个&lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="ActionPoint"&gt;动作&lt;/LSTag&gt;同时挥出双刀，且不受通常的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻击检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;减值。</content>
	<content contentuid="h734cadfag741eg45d3ga660g0cb8a1d142bf" version="1">礼数需有回应</content>
	<content contentuid="hd5a3e7a4g7d40g4687gaa36g2f8453583957" version="1">当一名&lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;生命值&lt;/LSTag&gt;超过一半的敌人击中铁心时，他会欺身上前，以四记斩击作答。</content>
	<content contentuid="h32221947g3de3g4670g893dg8a7bbe67c4e1" version="1">锁镰</content>
	<content contentuid="haebe50f3gbcb5g4467gaf13g41901dfb0025" version="1">当敌人以远程攻击或法术击中铁心时，他会甩出带钩的锁链将其拉到身前，并造成 &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;。若&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Dexterity"&gt;敏捷&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;失败，攻击者将&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="PRONE"&gt;倒地&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>

	<content contentuid="h54120d2bgfba7g4264ga667g764b212b6c31" version="1">介错</content>
	<content contentuid="h4c29ac3fge735g417dgb851g08fb750c026e" version="1">铁心的主刀，忠实地侍奉了他四百年，早已浸透龙泉的魔力。</content>
	<content contentuid="h311262d6g2047g4e7eg8ef0gb264179b60cf" version="1">小慈悲</content>
	<content contentuid="h5e411073gb26fg4716g8781g206c656ad4bf" version="1">这把短刀即使在屋内也不离身。它本是为他自己的手准备的，而那一刻始终未至。</content>

	<content contentuid="he2b56119g711eg4f50g89f5g2c71742d6d22" version="1">命中时额外造成 &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;。目标必须通过&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Constitution"&gt;体质&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，否则将陷入&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="PARALYZED"&gt;麻痹&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h1368544dg3b47g447dgaa8bg473ebc77b4f4" version="1">命中时额外造成 &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;。目标必须通过&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Constitution"&gt;体质&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，否则将沉睡。任何伤害都会唤醒沉睡者。</content>
	<content contentuid="h49a057f9g37ecg46ebga1fbg421aa18144cc" version="1">黑漆</content>
	<content contentuid="h2c62c042g528ag4af8g9ab7g70e26345d32e" version="1">陷入&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="PARALYZED"&gt;麻痹&lt;/LSTag&gt;的生物无法移动或行动。它自动失败力量与敏捷&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，针对它的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻击检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;拥有&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Advantage"&gt;优势&lt;/LSTag&gt;，且来自 [1] 之内的命中均为&lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;重击&lt;/LSTag&gt;。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;在每回合结束时通过&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Constitution"&gt;体质&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;即可解除该效果。</content>
	<content contentuid="h669697ffg0996g424dgbcfbg5be3719b7358" version="1">慈悲</content>
	<content contentuid="h8adf7fa5g7841g4980gbf42g821bd6f8dfce" version="1">沉睡的生物无法移动或行动。它自动失败力量与敏捷&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，针对它的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻击检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;拥有&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Advantage"&gt;优势&lt;/LSTag&gt;，且来自 [1] 之内的命中均为&lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;重击&lt;/LSTag&gt;。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;受到任何伤害，或有同伴对其施以&lt;LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Target_Help"&gt;帮助&lt;/LSTag&gt;时解除。</content>

	<content contentuid="hfdd821abg74eag4a07g828bge0553df0c26b" version="1">唉，还要多久！杀了我吧，可怜可怜老头子！</content>
	<content contentuid="hcf16fcc8g5d2eg49acga4b5g648bc3db9750" version="1">你现在不杀我，就要被诅咒一辈子！</content>
	<content contentuid="hf7a0691bg3f80g4406g9747gea985a9a95e8" version="1">呼，抱歉！不，不抱歉！</content>
	<content contentuid="hdbcb9479g7b8dg4589g848fg54a14df694a5" version="1">真残忍……却也真仁慈。</content>

	<content contentuid="h39a7c065g758eg4e2dg8bd7g14fba6e5a137" version="1">我又回到自己的身体里了……堂堂正正地斩下我吧。</content>
	<content contentuid="hd8114d54gd9cdg4763gb624g29cbed8de70e" version="1">至黑者，我还要向你复仇！</content>
	<content contentuid="h54984d68g09abg4e58g867cgd16b619c79cf" version="1">就照武人之道所言那样出手——无所畏惧。</content>
	<content contentuid="heb42c4e7g0753g4eafg8aa6g876a3ee35008" version="1">那是小孩子的一击。去找你的破绽。</content>
	<content contentuid="h85efc22dgb08dg428dgba0cgb6a24efc39ff" version="1">让我看看你怎么挨这一下。</content>
	<content contentuid="hefa0588ege072g4437ga261g748409b431df" version="1">我只期待与你堂堂正正一战，别的都是耻辱。</content>
	<content contentuid="h05c818d7g4a50g4126g9006g0017b23c8777" version="1">这两把刀切开血肉如同切黄油。</content>
	<content contentuid="he35d8867g0550g47e9g9b9bgcad3e1652fbd" version="1">别跑。我们还有得打呢！</content>
	<content contentuid="h2e047b44ge806g4d6cgbfa0geeef5063e5fa" version="1">好一击。可惜太轻。</content>
	<content contentuid="h926911fbgb00dg44c4g8f32g6e41de9aab3e" version="1">龙泉仍抓着我不放……</content>

	<content contentuid="he51062e5g51bfg431dgb25bgfa6a83df2999" version="1">咔嚓。咔嚓。咔嚓。</content>
	<content contentuid="hb5289e60gdf15g431bg82c4ga41435cd3443" version="1">沙沙 沙沙 沙沙</content>
	<content contentuid="h803f1183gc117g4165g991dgeb88fc1235bf" version="1">咔！咔……咔……</content>
	<content contentuid="hbc56fab5ge34fg4888ga326g602584e113e3" version="1">……嚓。</content>
</contentList>
